 you get up to use the bathroom in the middle of the night.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_59","text":"Oh, okay. I get it. You know there's nothing to be afraid of, but it's still a little scary.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_60","text":"You get me, hero. I think you and I could make a great team.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_61","text":"Haha. As they say, allies are simply those who share your same fears!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_62","text":"Can you two focus for a second?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_63","text":"As you can see, there are a lot of Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_64","text":"It's nothing we can't handle, but we'll still need to give it everything we've got.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_65","text":"And we don't know when that Heretic missile will come down from above.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_66","text":"Look at this!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_67","text":"Wh-what is that?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_Chap_41_02_2","bgArt":"eventscene_chap_41_02_2","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_68","text":"It's an electric dinosaur!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_69","text":"Whoa! Impressive! It looks super realistic!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_70","text":"Ugh...! Agghhh...! Grrrrr...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_71","text":"You know what sounds good for lunch? Omurice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"OldArkGate","bgArt":"oldarkgate","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["maxwell_p","drake_p","laplace_p"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_72","text":"Okay. Look, we've got to intercept that Heretic missile no matter what.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_73","text":"If that thing goes off, the Ark is finished.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_74","text":"We're going to have to conserve our energy while also fighting at full strength. Got it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_75","text":"What does that even mean? It's like saying we need to eat the main dish and all the sides, too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_76","text":"Is that supposed to be an analogy?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_77","text":"Are we getting any support from the Ark?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_78","text":"They said they'll be sending some up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_79","text":"With this many Raptures, though, it's hard to say how much it'll actually help.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_80","text":"What happens if we lose?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_81","text":"Then it's all over. We don't get another chance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_82","text":"Exactly. If that many Raptures make it into the Ark,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_83","text":"or if the chemical weapon detonates above the Ark,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_84","text":"or if we make even one small misstep, the Ark is done for.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_85","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_86","text":"I'm fired up!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_87","text":"Hmph. This is our last chance, huh? I like our odds.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_88","text":"Come at us, you filthy Raptures!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_89","text":"We'll never let you take the Ark!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger2_04_e_90","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger2_04_e_90","text":"The Matis Squad charges toward the enemy lines.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}